@startuml logic-auth-oauth
title UniChat — OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code + PKCE (reference logic from master)

actor User
participant "Angular UI" as UI
participant "auth_provider\ncommand" as CMD
participant "OAuthService\n(services/auth/oauth.service.rs)" as OA
participant "OAuthStateService" as ST
participant "OAuthLoopbackService" as LB
participant "Token exchange\n(provider token endpoint)" as TX
database "nosql_orm JSON store\n(auth accounts)" as DB

User -> UI: clicks "Connect <platform>"
UI -> CMD: auth_start(platform)
CMD -> OA: start_auth(platform)
OA -> OA: parse_loopback_redirect(redirect_uri)\n-> (host, port, path)
OA -> LB: start_listener(key, host, port, path)
OA -> ST: create_session(platform)\n=> state + code_verifier
OA -> OA: pkce_challenge(verifier) [S256]
OA --> CMD: authorize URL\n(client_id, redirect_uri, response_type=code,\n scope, state, code_challenge, method=S256)
CMD --> UI: url
UI -> User: opens system browser

User -> LB: GET callback ?code&state  (or ?error)
LB -> ST: validate state against session
alt state mismatch / error param
  LB --> CMD: Err("<error_code>: <description>")
else valid
  CMD -> OA: complete_auth(platform, callback_url)
  OA -> TX: POST code + code_verifier + client_id + redirect_uri
  TX --> OA: access_token, refresh_token, expires_in
  OA -> DB: upsert ChatAccountModel\n(access_token, refresh_token, expires_at=now+expires_in)
  OA --> CMD: AuthAccountModel
end
CMD --> UI: account saved

== Session maintenance ==
UI -> CMD: auth_status(platform)
CMD -> DB: load account; compare expires_at vs Utc::now()
UI -> CMD: auth_refresh(platform)
CMD -> TX: POST refresh_token grant
CMD -> DB: rotate stored tokens
UI -> CMD: auth_validate(platform) / auth_disconnect(platform)

note over CMD: dioxus-migration status: all seven handlers exist in\nwebapp/src/application/handlers/handlers.rs but return canned\ndefaults — no loopback listener, no PKCE, no token exchange, no store.
@enduml
